= Politics

{!<div id="rf-relations"></div>!}

{!<div class="rf-block"><div class="rf-block-head"><span class="p-spd">Social Democrats</span></div>!}

{!<p><span class="tooltip-text" title="The line the SPD chose at its last congress. It only changes at the next one, and it limits how close the SPD can come to the KPD.">Course</span>: !}[+ spd_course_name +]{!</p>!}

{!<p><span class="tooltip-text" title="How much weight the SPD's left wing carries. A KPD that seeks the united front gives the left arguments inside its own party; risings and abuse give them to the right. The SPD's coalitions with the bourgeois parties also push its members left. The next congress reads it.">Left wing</span>: !}[+ spd_left_word +][+ n_spd_left +]{!</p>!}

{!<p><span class="tooltip-text" title="Where the SPD will next choose its course.">Next SPD congress</span>: !}[+ spd_next_congress +]{!</p>!}

[? if spd_news != "" : {!<p><i>!}[+ spd_news +]{!</i></p>!} ?]{!</div>!}

